			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1786604121458,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "ArtifactResolver stores the strategy objects supplied to it and delegates to the first strategy whose can_resolve() matches.\n\nInlineArtifactStrategy and StoredFileArtifactStrategy implement the ArtifactResolutionStrategy protocol.\n\nResolvedArtifact is returned and held only as a local variable during execute(). Therefore it is a dependency / uses-a object, not an\nowned part.",
			"rawText": "ArtifactResolver stores the strategy objects supplied to it and delegates to the first strategy whose can_resolve() matches.\n\nInlineArtifactStrategy and StoredFileArtifactStrategy implement the ArtifactResolutionStrategy protocol.\n\nResolvedArtifact is returned and held only as a local variable during execute(). Therefore it is a dependency / uses-a object, not an owned part.",
			"originalText": "ArtifactResolver stores the strategy objects supplied to it and delegates to the first strategy whose can_resolve() matches.\n\nInlineArtifactStrategy and StoredFileArtifactStrategy implement the ArtifactResolutionStrategy protocol.\n\nResolvedArtifact is returned and held only as a local variable during execute(). Therefore it is a dependency / uses-a object, not an owned part.",
			"fontSize": 16.59016572130699,
