			"updated": 1786604317241,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "PromptBuilder turns ResolvedArtifact into the first Prompt.\n\nRepairPromptBuilder uses the original Prompt and JsonValidationResult to return a repaired Prompt.\n\nPrompt contains a list of PromptMessage objects. This is composition because messages are the internal parts of a\nPrompt.",
			"rawText": "PromptBuilder turns ResolvedArtifact into the first Prompt.\n\nRepairPromptBuilder uses the original Prompt and JsonValidationResult to return a repaired Prompt.\n\nPrompt contains a list of PromptMessage objects. This is composition because messages are the internal parts of a Prompt.",
			"originalText": "PromptBuilder turns ResolvedArtifact into the first Prompt.\n\nRepairPromptBuilder uses the original Prompt and JsonValidationResult to return a repaired Prompt.\n\nPrompt contains a list of PromptMessage objects. This is composition because messages are the internal parts of a Prompt.",
			"fontSize": 17,
