			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1786604380175,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "ProviderService stores the ProviderFactory injected through its constructor: association + dependency injection.\n\nProviderFactory creates a provider on demand and returns it, but does not keep it: creation dependency, not composition.\n\nOCI and OpenAI providers implement GenerationProvider. ProviderService can call the same generate() method on either implementation: polymorphism.\n\nEach provider stores its independent config object: association / has-a.",
			"rawText": "ProviderService stores the ProviderFactory injected through its constructor: association + dependency injection.\n\nProviderFactory creates a provider on demand and returns it, but does not keep it: creation dependency, not composition.\n\nOCI and OpenAI providers implement GenerationProvider. ProviderService can call the same generate() method on either implementation: polymorphism.\n\nEach provider stores its independent config object: association / has-a.",
			"originalText": "ProviderService stores the ProviderFactory injected through its constructor: association + dependency injection.\n\nProviderFactory creates a provider on demand and returns it, but does not keep it: creation dependency, not composition.\n\nOCI and OpenAI providers implement GenerationProvider. ProviderService can call the same generate() method on either implementation: polymorphism.\n\nEach provider stores its independent config object: association / has-a.",
			"fontSize": 17,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"index": "b0j",
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
