			"updated": 1786604408617,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "JsonResponseValidator receives ModelResponse and returns JsonValidationResult.\n\nThe orchestrator reads that result and creates ExecutionResponse.\n\nDomain exceptions inherit StructuredOutputError. main catches the base type, so all specialized errors can be handled\nconsistently.",
			"rawText": "JsonResponseValidator receives ModelResponse and returns JsonValidationResult.\n\nThe orchestrator reads that result and creates ExecutionResponse.\n\nDomain exceptions inherit StructuredOutputError. main catches the base type, so all specialized errors can be handled consistently.",
			"originalText": "JsonResponseValidator receives ModelResponse and returns JsonValidationResult.\n\nThe orchestrator reads that result and creates ExecutionResponse.\n\nDomain exceptions inherit StructuredOutputError. main catches the base type, so all specialized errors can be handled consistently.",
