			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1786556946354,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Dependency / uses-a\n“I borrow you for one task.” Seen as a parameter, return type, or local variable.\nExample: PromptBuilder uses ResolvedArtifact.\n\nCreation dependency\n“I create you when requested, but I do not keep you.”\nExample: ProviderFactory creates provider adapters.\n\nDelegation\n“I received the task; a specialist performs it.”\nExample: ProviderService delegates to provider.generate().",
			"rawText": "Dependency / uses-a\n“I borrow you for one task.” Seen as a parameter, return type, or local variable.\nExample: PromptBuilder uses ResolvedArtifact.\n\nCreation dependency\n“I create you when requested, but I do not keep you.”\nExample: ProviderFactory creates provider adapters.\n\nDelegation\n“I received the task; a specialist performs it.”\nExample: ProviderService delegates to provider.generate().",
			"originalText": "Dependency / uses-a\n“I borrow you for one task.” Seen as a parameter, return type, or local variable.\nExample: PromptBuilder uses ResolvedArtifact.\n\nCreation dependency\n“I create you when requested, but I do not keep you.”\nExample: ProviderFactory creates provider adapters.\n\nDelegation\n“I received the task; a specialist performs it.”\nExample: ProviderService delegates to provider.generate().",
			"fontSize": 17,
			"fontFamily": 5,
