			"updated": 1786556946354,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Inheritance / is-a\n“I am a specialized form of you.” A child derives from a parent.\nExample: InvalidInputError is-a StructuredOutputError.\n\nProtocol realization / implements-a\n“I provide every operation promised by this contract.”\nExample: OciGenerationProvider implements GenerationProvider.\n\nPolymorphism\n“One operation, many runtime forms.”\nExample: generate() runs OCI or OpenAI-specific behavior.",
			"rawText": "Inheritance / is-a\n“I am a specialized form of you.” A child derives from a parent.\nExample: InvalidInputError is-a StructuredOutputError.\n\nProtocol realization / implements-a\n“I provide every operation promised by this contract.”\nExample: OciGenerationProvider implements GenerationProvider.\n\nPolymorphism\n“One operation, many runtime forms.”\nExample: generate() runs OCI or OpenAI-specific behavior.",
			"originalText": "Inheritance / is-a\n“I am a specialized form of you.” A child derives from a parent.\nExample: InvalidInputError is-a StructuredOutputError.\n\nProtocol realization / implements-a\n“I provide every operation promised by this contract.”\nExample: OciGenerationProvider implements GenerationProvider.\n\nPolymorphism\n“One operation, many runtime forms.”\nExample: generate() runs OCI or OpenAI-specific behavior.",
