			"text": "Association                     solid line                 ─────\nAggregation                     solid line + hollow diamond ◇─────   (diamond at the whole/owner)\nComposition                     solid line + filled diamond ◆─────   (diamond at the whole/owner)\nDependency                      dashed arrow               - - - →\nInheritance                     solid line + hollow triangle ─────▷   (triangle points to parent)\nProtocol/interface realization  dashed line + hollow triangle - - - ▷ (triangle points to protocol)\nDelegation                      association/dependency line labelled «delegates»",
			"rawText": "Association                     solid line                 ─────\nAggregation                     solid line + hollow diamond ◇─────   (diamond at the whole/owner)\nComposition                     solid line + filled diamond ◆─────   (diamond at the whole/owner)\nDependency                      dashed arrow               - - - →\nInheritance                     solid line + hollow triangle ─────▷   (triangle points to parent)\nProtocol/interface realization  dashed line + hollow triangle - - - ▷ (triangle points to protocol)\nDelegation                      association/dependency line labelled «delegates»",
